# Architecture — Living Spatial Mindspace

## Scene Structure
Two scenes managed by Unity's SceneManager:
- MainMenu (index 0): UI-only scene, loads on startup
- SampleScene (index 1): the 3D world

## Core Scripts

### Player system
FirstPersonController.cs — WASD movement and mouse-look via CharacterController. Freezes completely when edit panel is open. Escape returns to main menu with cursor unlock and cooldown timer.

### Knowledge card system
KnowledgeCard.cs — owns a card's type, content, and visual state. Exposes GetContent and SetContent for save and AI systems.

CardInteractor.cs — fires a raycast from screen center each frame. Detects which card the player is looking at and handles E (edit), G (grab and move), Delete. Deactivates card before destroying to prevent save-race condition.

CardSpawner.cs — spawns typed card prefabs on N, T, I keypresses. Blocked while edit panel is open.

CardEditUI.cs — Canvas overlay using OnGUI() for text capture. Bypasses Unity's EventSystem entirely for reliable keyboard input in Unity 6.

### Persistence
WorldSaveManager.cs — singleton. Serializes all KnowledgeCard positions, rotations, types and content to JSON using JsonUtility. Saves on every card change. Loads automatically on Start().

Save file location: Application.persistentDataPath/worldsave.json

### AI Curator system
AICurator.cs — singleton. Runs ScanAllCards() on a 30-second repeating loop and after every save. For each card pair, computes word-overlap similarity after stop-word removal and tokenisation. Pairs above 0.2 threshold form a CardConnection.

CuratorOrb.cs — waypoint-based wandering near room perimeter at ceiling height. Actively avoids player position. Flashes emission when new connections are discovered.

ConnectionRenderer.cs — reads AICurator connections list and creates LineRenderer objects between related card pairs. Line width and alpha encode connection strength. Pulses opacity each frame for a living quality.

CuratorLightController.cs — point light that pulses gently at idle and spikes intensity when the curator finds new connections.

### Main menu
MainMenuController.cs — checks for save file existence to show Enter vs Continue. Unlocks cursor on load.

## Data flow

User edits card
→ CardEditUI.EndEditing()
→ KnowledgeCard.SetContent()
→ WorldSaveManager.SaveWorld() writes JSON to disk
→ AICurator.ScanAllCards() re-analyses all text
→ ConnectionRenderer.DrawConnections() redraws lines
→ CuratorLightController.TriggerFlash() room reacts to discovery

